From dcc55ee67e7fff8945af40536f97b8c1d2596737 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 01:04:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Tests of the layouts: execution forms, end of time step,
 conversions

- integration of managers stored point by point and component by
  component on ranges, empty ranges, with a thread pool, with the
  synchronous and asynchronous policies, and revert.
- initialize functions and post-processings with and without inputs, on
  ranges, with a thread pool and with policies.
- update and revert of the material properties and of the external state
  variables given by external arrays, local arrays and uniform values,
  with the update policies, with and without field operations.
- conversions of the finite strain stresses and tangent operators on
  views, in 3D and in plane strain, and first Piola-Kirchhoff stress
  compared to its definition.
- views on the variables and strided coalesced views of the
  thermodynamic forces and of the internal state variables.
---
 tests/MaterialDataManagerLayoutTest.cxx | 495 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 495 insertions(+)

